//RS     // D-HONESTNUM1=A: Measurement<T> — a value paired with its standard uncertainty.
//RS     // Arithmetic propagates uncertainty using the standard quadrature rules.
//RS     // Only `JetMeasurement<f64>` (Float) is exposed to Jet programs.
//RS     #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq)]
